            "review_text": "Tom L S\nLondon, United Kingdom82 contributions\n0\nAte On Two Days - Brilliant\nFeb 2023\nFamily owned business, female owner understands English and some of her staff do to. The Vietnamese food is all prepared and on show at the entrance, you choose the items and they show you to a table and place a number card next to you to facilitate payment. They bring food to you, you eat and then you can either ask for the bill or go to the back of the room where the cashier sits and pay. I had rice, various bamboo things and fried fish. Totally delicious and the price was cheap by UK standards and the place was buzzing with locals too. I said to the owner I'd leave them a review , well here it is.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 20, 2023",
